{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"王阳明·ideas-and-methods","stage":"DONE","category":"wang-yangming","categoryLabel":"王阳明","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/24_wang-yangming/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"王阳明-思想与方法\">王阳明·思想与方法</h1><p>本 hub 系统拆解王阳明（1472—1529）心学的<strong>思想内核与修养方法</strong>，沿三条主线展开：在&quot;心即理&quot;上，他提出&quot;心外无理&quot;&quot;心外无物&quot;，确立心的根本地位，并与朱熹（1130—1200）展开系统对峙；在&quot;良知&quot;上，他揭示良知作为本然光明、知善知恶的道德本体，并以&quot;明镜&quot;喻其本体与工夫；在修养上，他主张&quot;知行本体&quot;&quot;事上磨练&quot;，把成圣落实于日用伦常。三条主线共同呈现一种高扬道德主体、即知即行、注重实践的哲学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>王阳明集合下有六个 hub，本 hub 是其中的&quot;义理解析层&quot;，与兄弟 hub 分工如下，避免重复展开同一事实：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他经历了什么（格竹、龙场悟道、平宸濠、临终&quot;此心光明&quot;）</td>\n<td>提供本 hub 思想的<strong>史实背景</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他贡献了哪三大命题（心即理·知行合一·致良知）</td>\n<td>提供<strong>纲领性概览</strong>，本 hub 是其<strong>深度展开</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>思想与方法（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>这些命题的<strong>义理结构、相互关系、工夫下手处</strong></td>\n<td>——</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表著作</a></td>\n<td>思想载于何处（传习录·大学问·四句教）</td>\n<td>提供本 hub 的<strong>文本出处</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>心学如何传播、流变、至今有何意义</td>\n<td>承接本 hub 思想的<strong>下游效应</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>朱王之辩、近禅之讥、事功心性之辨如何评判</td>\n<td>对本 hub 各命题的<strong>批判性回响</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>简言之：要史实去&quot;生平&quot;，要速览去&quot;核心贡献&quot;，要评判去&quot;争议&quot;，要原文去&quot;著作&quot;；<strong>要把命题想透、把工夫想清，留在本 hub。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[前置: 核心贡献 三大命题概览] --&gt; A[1 心即理: 心外无理]&#10;  A --&gt; B[1 与朱熹的分歧]&#10;  B --&gt; C[2 良知本体]&#10;  C --&gt; D[2 心如明镜: 本体与工夫]&#10;  D --&gt; E[3 知行本体]&#10;  E --&gt; F[3 事上磨练: 落地日用]&#10;  F --&gt; G[延伸: 著作四句教 / 争议评价]\">flowchart TD\n  P[前置: 核心贡献 三大命题概览] --&gt; A[1 心即理: 心外无理]\n  A --&gt; B[1 与朱熹的分歧]\n  B --&gt; C[2 良知本体]\n  C --&gt; D[2 心如明镜: 本体与工夫]\n  D --&gt; E[3 知行本体]\n  E --&gt; F[3 事上磨练: 落地日用]\n  F --&gt; G[延伸: 著作四句教 / 争议评价]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：先读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 建立&quot;心即理—知行合一—致良知&quot;三命题的全局，再入本 hub 求深。</li>\n<li><strong>第一站·心与理</strong>：<a href=\"mind-and-principle/no-principle-outside-mind\">心外无理</a> 立本体论原点 → <a href=\"mind-and-principle/against-zhu-xi\">与朱熹的分歧</a> 看其对峙坐标。</li>\n<li><strong>第二站·良知</strong>：<a href=\"liangzhi/the-innate-moral-knowing\">良知本体</a> 讲良知&quot;是什么&quot; → <a href=\"liangzhi/the-clear-mirror\">心如明镜</a> 讲良知&quot;如何修&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>第三站·修养</strong>：<a href=\"self-cultivation/unity-of-knowledge-action\">知行本体</a> 讲知行为何本一 → <a href=\"self-cultivation/everyday-practice\">事上磨练</a> 讲工夫如何落地。</li>\n<li><strong>延伸</strong>：命题的纲领性总结见 <a href=\"../major-works/four-axioms/\">著作·四句教与天泉证道</a>；各命题的争议见 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一条贯穿的主线\">一条贯穿的主线</h2><p>本 hub 六篇虽分三章，却由一条逻辑链串起：<strong>心即理</strong>（理在本心）→ 理即<strong>良知</strong>（本心之昭明）→ 良知须<strong>致</strong>（去蔽存明）→ 致良知即<strong>知行合一</strong>（即知即行）→ 知行合一落于<strong>事上磨练</strong>（日用伦常即道场）。把握这条链，便把握了阳明学&quot;本体与工夫合一&quot;&quot;高明而不离日用&quot;的全部精神。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mind-and-principle","title":"Mind And Principle","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/mind-and-principle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"no-principle-outside-mind","title":"心外无理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/mind-and-principle/no-principle-outside-mind"},{"seq":2,"slug":"against-zhu-xi","title":"与朱熹的分歧","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/mind-and-principle/against-zhu-xi"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"liangzhi","title":"Liangzhi","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/liangzhi","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-innate-moral-knowing","title":"良知本体","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/liangzhi/the-innate-moral-knowing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-clear-mirror","title":"心如明镜","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/liangzhi/the-clear-mirror"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"self-cultivation","title":"Self Cultivation","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/self-cultivation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unity-of-knowledge-action","title":"知行本体","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/self-cultivation/unity-of-knowledge-action"},{"seq":2,"slug":"everyday-practice","title":"事上磨练","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/ideas-and-methods/self-cultivation/everyday-practice"}]}]}